# Sales Data Analysis using Pandas & Matplotlib

This mini project focuses on analyzing and visualizing a small sales dataset using **Pandas**, **Matplotlib**, and **Seaborn** in Python. It includes data cleaning, feature creation, and insightful charts to understand sales performance.

## Project Highlights

- Created a sample sales dataset manually
- Cleaned missing values and removed duplicates
- Added calculated columns: `Cost`, `Profit`, and `Profit Margin`
- Performed basic data exploration using Pandas
- Visualized key insights with:
  - Bar charts
  - Pie chart
  - Line chart (Sales Trend & Cumulative Sales)
  - Boxplot
  - Seaborn-styled visuals

---

## 🔍 Key Insights

-  Laptops generated the highest revenue and profit
-  Delhi had the highest total sales among all cities
-  Cumulative sales showed steady growth
-  Profit margins were consistent across most products

